%% Vista dinámica — POST /predict (contrato)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Médico (Streamlit)
  participant G as HttpGateway
  participant A as FastAPI /predict
  participant S as PneumoniaService
  participant R as select_reader (Estrategia)
  participant P as preprocess (CLAHE)
  participant K as KerasClassifier
  participant D as ThresholdPolicy
  participant X as GradCamExplainer
  U->>G: archivo .dcm/.jpg + documento
  G->>A: multipart/form-data file
  A->>A: vacío o > 20 MB → 422
  A->>S: predict_bytes(data, filename)
  S->>R: firma binaria (DICM / FFD8 / PNG) → lector
  R-->>S: RadiographImage (uint8 + metadatos sin PHI)
  Note over R,S: archivo corrupto → InvalidImageError → 422
  S->>P: preprocess(pixels)
  P-->>S: tensor (1,512,512,1)
  S->>K: predict_proba
  K-->>S: [P(bact), P(normal), P(viral)]
  S->>D: decide(probs)
  D-->>S: label, probability, subtype, target_index
  S->>X: explain(batch, target_index)
  X-->>S: mapa 31×31 → overlay JET 512×512
  S-->>A: Prediction
  A->>A: guarda PNG → gradcam_url
  A-->>G: 200 {label, probability, gradcam_url, ...}
  G->>A: GET gradcam_url
  G-->>U: resultado + Grad-CAM + metadatos
  U->>U: PDF (fpdf2) / historial CSV
